Subject: [PATCH] fix: allow RoadSTR in Motorola eUICC policy

The shared Motorola allowlist gates the stock eUICC flow. Add RoadSTR
without changing other entries. This device-specific entry remains here
because the shared package owns its resource; prefer a product overlay
if upstream later provides an equivalent supported override.

Change-Id: I79d3ae31cbb1372cb09965f358a9b3fdb1748955
---
 overlay/EuiccPolicyMoto/res/values/strings.xml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/overlay/EuiccPolicyMoto/res/values/strings.xml b/overlay/EuiccPolicyMoto/res/values/strings.xml
index c98b9aa..ddbc2e0 100644
--- a/overlay/EuiccPolicyMoto/res/values/strings.xml
+++ b/overlay/EuiccPolicyMoto/res/values/strings.xml
@@ -65,6 +65,7 @@
                         \"paros\",
                         \"penang\",
                         \"pnangn\",
+                        \"roadstr\",
                         \"rtwo\",
                         \"scout\",
                         \"sorap\",
